00:33:59.040 --> 00:34:02.980
while you're doing the same type of inputs over and over again,

00:34:03.100 --> 00:34:06.080
while you're looking at the same thing over and over again,

00:34:06.080 --> 00:34:11.900
you're setting yourself up for failure within the first five minutes of playing a game.

00:34:12.160 --> 00:34:17.700
So, this makes me think that, like, this is the kind of game that is made, but not tested.

00:34:18.000 --> 00:34:19.900
